msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/vendor_runtime_module.rst:31
msgid "Since this is a runtime module whose functionality is meant to only be accessed from the running project, you must generate an export template for every platform you plan to support. See the :ref:`Compiling <toc-devel-compiling>` pages for more information."
msgstr ""

